","sourceKey":"official/15/0/0","gameDataKey":"Yunara/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"영혼 단련","en_US":"Cultivation of Spirit","zh_CN":"灵蕴拳"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"일부 아이템을 사용할 경우 공격이 튕길 때마다 중첩이 여러 번 쌓이던 버그를 수정했습니다. 이제 의도했던 대로 유나라의 공격이 한 번 튕길 때마다 중첩이 1회 쌓입니다.","en_US":"Fixed a bug where sometimes the bounce could trigger multiple stacks per bounce for some items. It's intended for Yunara to build 1 stack per bounce.","zh_CN":"之前裝備部分道具時，每次彈跳會累加堆層多次，現已修正此問題。每次彈跳時，尤娜拉只應累加1層。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/15/0/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/15/0/1","gameDataKey":"Yunara/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"영혼 단련","en_US":"Cultivation of Spirit","zh_CN":"灵蕴拳"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"Q - 영혼 단련으로 공격이 매우 많이 튕길 때 가끔 튕긴 공격에 아이템 피해량이 적용되지 않던 버그를 수정했습니다. (내부의 계산기를 든 포로들이 이제 준비됐다고 합니다.)","en_US":"Fixed an issue where sometimes items would fail to do damage on Q bounces in situations where a significant number of bounces were taking place. (The poros on the calculators behind the scenes are ready now)","zh_CN":"之前在Q彈跳次數過多的情況下，道具會無法造成傷害，現已修正此問題。（在幕後按計算機的普羅已準備就緒）"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/15/0/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/15/0/2","gameDataKey":"Yunara/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"영혼 단련","en_US":"Cultivation of Spirit","zh_CN":"灵蕴拳"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"루난의 허리케인 같은 아이템을 사용할 때 2차 대상에게서 주 대상으로 튕긴 공격에 전체 적중 시 피해량이 적용되어, 단일 대상을 여러 번 공격하는 게 전체 적중 시 효과를 발동시키던 버그를 수정했습니다.","en_US":"Fixed an issue where items like Runnan's Hurricane were dealing full on-hit damage when bouncing from the secondary target to the primary target, triggering the full-on hit value multiple times in a single auto.","zh_CN":"之前從次要目標彈到主要目標時，芮蘭颶風箭等道具會造成全額命中傷害，導致單次普攻可造成全額命中傷害多次，現已修正此問題。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/15/0/3","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/15/0/3","gameDataKey":"Yunara/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"영혼 단련","en_US":"Cultivation of Spirit","zh_CN":"灵蕴拳"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"루난의 허리케인 탄환의 적중 시 피해량이 잘못 감소하던 버그를 수정했습니다. 이제 전체 적중 시 피해량이 올바르게 적용됩니다.","en_US":"Fixed an issue where Runnan's Hurricane bolts were having their on-hit damage reduced incorrectly and will now apply the full on-hit damage correctly.","zh_CN":"之前芮蘭颶風箭的命中傷害過低，此問題已經修正，現在會正確地造成全額命中傷害。"},"impact":"adjustment"}],"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"6696","kind":"item","name":{"ko_KR":"원칙의 원형낫","en_US":"Axiom Arc","zh_CN":"公理圆弧"},"changes":[{"id":"official/16/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/16/0/0","label":{"ko_KR":"총가격","en_US":"Total Gold Cost","zh_CN":"總價格"},"section":"stats","before":{"ko_KR":"3,000골드","en_US":"3000","zh_CN":"3000"},"after":{"ko_KR":"2,750골드","en_US":"2750","zh_CN":"2750"},"impact":"buff"}],"impact":"buff"},{"id":"4628","kind":"item","name":{"ko_KR":"지평선의 초점","en_US":"Horizon Focus","zh_CN":"视界专注"},"changes":[{"id":"official/17/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/17/0/0","gameDataKey":"Items/4628/mFlatMagicDamageMod","label":{"ko_KR":"주문력","en_US":"Ability Power","zh_CN":"魔攻"},"section":"stats","before":{"ko_KR":"115","en_US":"115","zh_CN":"115"},"after":{"ko_KR":"125","en_US":"125","zh_CN":"125"},"impact":"buff"},{"id":"official/17/0/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/17/0/1","label":{"ko_KR":"총가격","en_US":"Total Gold Cost","zh_CN":"總價格"},"section":"stats","before":{"ko_KR":"2,800골드","en_US":"2800","zh_CN":"2800"},"after":{"ko_KR":"2,750골드","en_US":"2750","zh_CN":"2750"},"impact":"buff"},{"id":"official/17/0/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/17/0/2","label":{"ko_KR":"아이템 조합식","en_US":"Rec